// spec: 7
// Overlapping shapes, and a box containing another box; a group containing a shape is fine.
diagram "overlap" size (400,300)
box a at (20,20) size (100,60)
box b at (80,50) size (100,60)
box outer at (220,20) size (160,120)
box inner at (240,40) size (40,40)
group g at (20,160) size (200,120) {
}
box loose at (40,200) size (40,40)
